f they were inhabited by sentient life  even if they would have been sustainable  sustenance for galactus and so with  someone as cold-blooded as morg galactus  wouldn't really have that problem now  not long after morg is brought on as his  herald galactus is confronted by the  silver surfer who was unaware that nova  had been dismissed and replaced now  galactus dispatches morg to battle the  silver surfer and during this battle we  see morgs power on full display he's  able to use his double-bladed axe to  absorb the silver server's energy  attacks and is even able to drain energy  from the surfer by touching him now the  battle concludes with morg using his  ability to project energy blasts against  the surfer and he's able to render him  unconscious so right off the bat we know  this guy is extremely powerful because  knocking the silver surfer out who is  well in and of himself just ridiculously  powerful requires an insane amount of  power and after experiencing how  ruthless morg is in battle the surfer  appeals to galactus to reconsider his  selection as a herald but galactus  ignores him now knowing that something  needs to be done about morgue before he  starts a blazing trail of destruction  across the galaxy silver surfer seeks  out the other heralds like firelord  terex nova and airwalker and if we don't  know anything else about these  characters we know that they were all  heralds at one point which means they're  all pretty powerful because usually once  you become a herald when you leave you  normally maintain the power that you got  from galactus so of course this lets us  know how big of a threat morgue really  is and so while the surfer is assembling  his team of former heralds morg is  leading galactus to planets for him to  consume and he comes to a planet where  he finds a well of life which the  planet's inhabitants worship for its  healing properties now when morg gets in  the well he finds his powers have been  augmented even further than 