 then  killed with the only other instance of  us seeing him was when annihilus  unsuccessfully tried to obtain the  remnants of the power cosmic from his  corpse so yeah that's basically  everything you need to know about morg  the executioner not a character that  gets talked about a lot but at the  height of his power he was way too much  for the silver surfer and an entire team  of former heralds meaning he's way  beyond omega level but let me know what  you guys think down in the comments  section right you you guys want us to  cover more just like obscure but  ridiculously op characters because in  all honesty we're running out of popular  op characters so i guess the obscure  ones are ones that we should focus on  next let me know what you guys think as  always leave your suggestions down in  the comments and i will catch you all  later  peace  you

